## Research sources

| URL | Principle | Applicability | Decision |
|-----|-----------|---------------|----------|
| https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/Understanding/status-messages | SC 4.1.3 status without focus move | Member success feedback | `aria-live` success copy |
| https://support.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/10413364615194 | Split view inbox + conversation | Operator layout | Keep split-pane command center |
| https://www.supportbench.com/customer-portal-accessibility-checklist-wcag-basics-support-teams/ | Clear labels, not placeholder-only | Member create form | Visible labels + advanced disclosure |
| Material Design 3 — chips (filters) | Toggle chip selected state | Portal status filters | `aria-pressed` + token styling |
